From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] office-ext: install hook for the Docs transliteration commands, and a column-selection arm

The three apps (wordcraft, wordcraft-web, wordcraft-cli) call docs_translit::install(&mut session) right after
Session::new, behind an empty `office-ext` feature: the upstream workspace compiles the call out with clean check-cfg,
and `cargo xt gen-domain` turns the feature on (default) and adds the optional docs-translit dependency. The commands
live in our crate (domains/docs/crates/docs-translit); install() appends three CommandSpecs to Session.registry.

column.rs: tools.translitCyrl, tools.translitLatn and tools.translitAuto join the per_row arm of the column dispatch.
Without it a column or cell selection falls into the generic `_ if mutates` arm, which collapses the selection to a
caret, and the commands would then read the empty selection as "convert the whole document".
---
 apps/wordcraft-cli/Cargo.toml   | 4 ++++
 apps/wordcraft-cli/src/main.rs  | 2 ++
 apps/wordcraft-web/Cargo.toml   | 4 ++++
 apps/wordcraft-web/src/web.rs   | 2 ++
 apps/wordcraft/Cargo.toml       | 4 ++++
 apps/wordcraft/src/main.rs      | 2 ++
 crates/engine/src/cmd/column.rs | 4 +++-
 7 files changed, 21 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/apps/wordcraft-cli/Cargo.toml b/apps/wordcraft-cli/Cargo.toml
index 7f9b25d..41f3def 100644
--- a/apps/wordcraft-cli/Cargo.toml
+++ b/apps/wordcraft-cli/Cargo.toml
@@ -13,6 +13,10 @@ path = "src/main.rs"
 [lints]
 workspace = true
 
+# office overlay (patches/wordcraft/0120): the domain build turns this on and adds the docs-translit dependency
+[features]
+office-ext = []
+
 [dependencies]
 wordcraft-doc = { workspace = true }
 wordcraft-engine = { workspace = true }
diff --git a/apps/wordcraft-cli/src/main.rs b/apps/wordcraft-cli/src/main.rs
index 4230645..13cee7d 100644
--- a/apps/wordcraft-cli/src/main.rs
+++ b/apps/wordcraft-cli/src/main.rs
@@ -101,6 +101,8 @@ fn text_args<S: AsRef<OsStr>>(raw: &[S]) -> Result<(Vec<String>, Option<PathBuf>
 /// same paper (#1381).
 fn session(doc: wordcraft_doc::Document) -> Session {
     let mut s = Session::new(doc);
+    #[cfg(feature = "office-ext")]
+    docs_translit::install(&mut s);
     s.system_region = system_region();
     s
 }
